19
00:00:59.880 --> 00:01:03.050
And I don't care what you look like on the outside,

20
00:01:03.050 --> 00:01:05.980
if you are stressed, if you are toxic inside,

21
00:01:05.980 --> 00:01:08.520
if you are miserable, if you are angry,

22
00:01:08.520 --> 00:01:11.270
all of these things come out and a smile's better

23
00:01:11.270 --> 00:01:15.280
than any lipstick you're ever gonna buy, period.

24
00:01:15.280 --> 00:01:17.670
You are really connecting something

25
00:01:17.670 --> 00:01:20.780
that I think is so inextricably linked.

26
00:01:20.780 --> 00:01:23.480
Thank you, they are, because the mind, the brain

27
00:01:23.480 --> 00:01:26.400 line:15%
