28
00:01:26.400 --> 00:01:28.660 line:15%
So they have all these interconnections

29
00:01:28.660 --> 00:01:30.300 line:15%
and it works in both ways.

30
00:01:30.300 --> 00:01:33.290 line:15%
And so when we're stressed, you can see it on our skin.

31
00:01:33.290 --> 00:01:35.710 line:15%
There's a stress hormone called cortisol,

32
00:01:35.710 --> 00:01:37.380
