36
00:01:43.820 --> 00:01:46.520
So when someone says, "I just got this wrinkle.",

37
00:01:46.520 --> 00:01:48.730
they're really stressed out

38
00:01:48.730 --> 00:01:50.440 line:15%
and it could age you pretty quickly.

39
00:01:50.440 --> 00:01:52.350 line:15%
It also causes the skin's barrier function

40
00:01:52.350 --> 00:01:55.030 line:15%
not to work as well to make our skin more sensitive.

41
00:01:55.030 --> 00:01:56.590 line:15%
So it causes a lot of bad things,

42
00:01:56.590 --> 00:01:57.897 line:15%
